{
  "schema_version": "1.0",
  "encounter_id": "00636",
  "segments": [
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0001",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 2.02,
      "end_seconds": 14.06,
      "duration_seconds": 12.04,
      "text": "Morning. I've had a temperature a couple of days and the wife said get it checked. Tick bite, last week."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0002",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 17.56,
      "end_seconds": 25.11,
      "duration_seconds": 7.55,
      "text": "Right. Where was the bite and how did you spot it? ~"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0003",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 28.54,
      "end_seconds": 39.1,
      "duration_seconds": 10.56,
      "text": "Back of my knee. Was walking the dog on the moor. Found it in the bath, pulled it off with tweezers. ~"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0004",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 41.57,
      "end_seconds": 47.71,
      "duration_seconds": 6.14,
      "text": "Good that you got it off. When did the temperature start?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0005",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 50.81,
      "end_seconds": 57.89,
      "duration_seconds": 7.08,
      "text": "Two days ago. I've felt hot and cold. Sweating at night."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0006",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 60.67,
      "end_seconds": 63.27,
      "duration_seconds": 2.6,
      "text": "Have you measured it?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0007",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 66.75,
      "end_seconds": 70.17,
      "duration_seconds": 3.42,
      "text": "Thirty-eight point four, last night."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0008",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 73.86,
      "end_seconds": 77.43,
      "duration_seconds": 3.57,
      "text": "Anything else along with it? ~"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0009",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 81.2,
      "end_seconds": 85.62,
      "duration_seconds": 4.42,
      "text": "Not really. A bit achy, nowt else. ~"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0010",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 88.4,
      "end_seconds": 93.34,
      "duration_seconds": 4.94,
      "text": "Right. And any long-term illnesses I should know about?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0011",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 96.12,
      "end_seconds": 101.29,
      "duration_seconds": 5.17,
      "text": "Asthma, since I was a lad. Nowt bad."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0012",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 103.45,
      "end_seconds": 107.91,
      "duration_seconds": 4.46,
      "text": "Let me take your temperature and pulse. ~"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0013",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 110.04,
      "end_seconds": 112.07,
      "duration_seconds": 2.03,
      "text": "Go on. ~"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0014",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 124.86,
      "end_seconds": 127.49,
      "duration_seconds": 2.63,
      "text": "Temperature 38.1, pulse 96."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0015",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 131.1,
      "end_seconds": 133.85,
      "duration_seconds": 2.75,
      "text": "So I've got one. ~"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0016",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 137.08,
      "end_seconds": 144.18,
      "duration_seconds": 7.1,
      "text": "You have. Let me see the bite site. Turn round. ~"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0017",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 155.83,
      "end_seconds": 158.87,
      "duration_seconds": 3.04,
      "text": "It's just a little scab."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0018",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 161.69,
      "end_seconds": 170.96,
      "duration_seconds": 9.27,
      "text": "I've had a look and it's healing well. Nothing spreading around it that I can see. ~"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0019",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 173.81,
      "end_seconds": 177.24,
      "duration_seconds": 3.43,
      "text": "So what's your thinking? ~"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0020",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 180.79,
      "end_seconds": 196.2,
      "duration_seconds": 15.41,
      "text": "A fever a week after a tick bite means I'd think of Lyme disease, though it could just be a virus, so I'm treating Lyme disease as a possibility, not a certainty."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0021",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 199.25,
      "end_seconds": 202.14,
      "duration_seconds": 2.89,
      "text": "What's the treatment? ~"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0022",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 204.86,
      "end_seconds": 212.67,
      "duration_seconds": 7.81,
      "text": "I'm not starting anything today. We'll see how it behaves first. ~"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0023",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 215.32,
      "end_seconds": 218.29,
      "duration_seconds": 2.97,
      "text": "Is that wise? ~"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0024",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 221.38,
      "end_seconds": 234.49,
      "duration_seconds": 13.11,
      "text": "With only a fever and no rash, yes. Treatment for Lyme is a course of tablets, and I'd rather not give it unless it's needed. ~"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0025",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 237.23,
      "end_seconds": 242.04,
      "duration_seconds": 4.81,
      "text": "Right. And what do I do meanwhile? ~"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0026",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 245.65,
      "end_seconds": 254.68,
      "duration_seconds": 9.03,
      "text": "Rest, plenty of fluids, and keep taking your temperature morning and night. Write the numbers down."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0027",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 258.36,
      "end_seconds": 260.49,
      "duration_seconds": 2.13,
      "text": "Fair enough. ~"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0028",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 264.15,
      "end_seconds": 275.3,
      "duration_seconds": 11.15,
      "text": "If the fever hasn't gone in two days, or a rash appears, or your joints swell, come back and see me that day."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0029",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 278.8,
      "end_seconds": 283.84,
      "duration_seconds": 5.04,
      "text": "Understood. And if it gets worse at the weekend? ~"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0030",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 286.62,
      "end_seconds": 294.54,
      "duration_seconds": 7.92,
      "text": "Ring the out-of-hours number and say you've had a tick bite. They'll know."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0031",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 298.17,
      "end_seconds": 300.76,
      "duration_seconds": 2.59,
      "text": "Right then. Thanks. ~"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0032",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 303.11,
      "end_seconds": 305.98,
      "duration_seconds": 2.87,
      "text": "Look after yourself. ~"
    }
  ]
}
